{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05D6C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你知道娇鹟吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不，没听说过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"是吗？难得都来到哥斯达黎加了，太可惜了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不，我又不是来看鸟的……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"娇鹟以优美的求偶舞而闻名。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"据说哥斯达黎加太平洋一侧栖息着橙领娇鹟，加勒比海一侧有白领娇鹟，中央盆地则有长尾娇鹟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"其中最有特点的就是长尾娇鹟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"有什么特别的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"它们会先拜资深雄鸟为师，学习舞蹈。然后组成一群，在雌鸟面前展示舞姿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过，最后真正能和雌鸟配对的只有师父。徒弟们要学习7年技巧，之后才能独立，再由自己招收徒弟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":136,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"7年……看来不管做什么，想独当一面都得花时间。无论舞者还是士兵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":94,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"娇鹟不愁吃的。听说就是因为太闲了，才会做这些事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"和我们还真不一样……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""}]}